# finish/rune: T6 runes on N (STYLE_P2 27.3; P2C_CONTRACTS 3b; LADDER-FINISH, ladder polish i1): the seam keeps its drawn
# step except one 2 px stroke every 12 px on the diagonal ((x + y) mod 12 < 2, one step Glow 2): a quiet mark of writing
# on a seam, never a neon outline nor a spray of cyan specks (the i3 blind panel read i3's 43 % as noise on the chest).
# T6's light lives in the glyph (one shape a piece) and the gems; the runes only hint. Glow cells write their step.
# Generated by LADDER-FINISH's gen_polish.py.
# Alloys i3 (LADDER-FINISH, A2 + A5): the seam is Glow 1 (g: the glow's darkest step, a dark line at the breath's trough that
# the breath lights to near white at its peak: the widest swing a glow pixel has) with a Glow 2 beat every 4th cell along any
# line ((x + 2y) mod 4 == 3: rows, columns and both diagonals all beat; i1's (x + y) mod 12 missed an up-right blade or ray
# whole). The Mythic's sun aegis: its eight N rays now burn as eight dark-ember rays at the trough and blaze at the peak
# (before: 2-4 stray orange specks on a flat orange disc, "fuzzy at game scale"); the T6 blade's fuller breathes end to end.
# Measured: C13 lt6 DRAWN bright 128 (cap 128), lt6m 125, soft 119-156 / 153-239 (cap 320). Generated by tools3/gen_i3.py.
use person
body adult
role overlay finish.rune
legend ! glow 2
legend : glow 3
legend g glow 1
tags tile overlay
on-region N

view D key rest origin 0 0
